            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 104:2",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 104,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Who layeth the beams of his chambers in the waters: who maketh the clouds his chariot: who walketh upon the wings of the wind:",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 67,
            "end": 73,
            "text": "Isa. 19:1."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 3,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Isa. 19:1.",
            "prettyString": "Isaiah 19:1",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "isaiah",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 19,
                    "end": 19,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 1,
                        "end": 1
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 104:3",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 104,
        "verse": 3
      },
      {
        "text": "Who maketh his angels spirits; his ministers a flaming fire:",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 11,
            "end": 29,
            "text": "OR the winds His messengers. TG Angels."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 4,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 104:4",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 104,
        "verse": 4
      },
      {
        "text": "Who laid the foundations of the earth, that it should not be removed for ever.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 3
          },
          {
            "start": 39,
            "end": 43
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 5,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 104:5",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 104,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "Thou coveredst it with the deep as with a garment: the waters stood above the mountains.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 55,
            "end": 61,
            "text": "Gen. 7:19."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 35,
            "end": 39
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Gen. 7:19.",
            "prettyString": "Genesis 7:19",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "genesis",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 7,
                    "end": 7,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 19,
                        "end": 19
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 104:6",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 104,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "At thy rebuke they fled; at the voice of thy thunder they hasted away.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 104:7",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 104,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "They go up by the mountains; they go down by the valleys unto the place which thou hast founded for them.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 104:8",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 104,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "Thou hast set a bound that they may not pass over; that they turn not again to cover the earth.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 79,
            "end": 84,
            "text": "Moses 7:51 (50–52)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 104:9",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 104,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "He sendeth the springs into the valleys, which run among the hills.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 15,
            "end": 22,
            "text": "TG Nature, Earth."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 41,
            "end": 46
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "TG Nature, Earth.",
            "prettyString": "TG Nature, Earth",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "studyHelp",
                "studyHelpType": "tg",
                "title": "Nature, Earth",
                "entryId": "tg-nature-earth",
                "book": "",
                "chapters": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 104:10",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 104,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "They give drink to every beast of the field: the wild asses quench their thirst.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 104:11",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 104,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "By them shall the fowls of the heaven have their habitation, which sing among the branches.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 61,
            "end": 66
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 104:12",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 104,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "He watereth the hills from his chambers: the earth is satisfied with the fruit of thy works.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 13,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 104:13",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 104,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
        "text": "He causeth the grass to grow for the cattle, and herb for the service of man: that he may bring forth food out of the earth;",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 14,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 104:14",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 104,
        "verse": 14
      },
      {
        "text": "And wine that maketh glad the heart of man, and oil to make his face to shine, and bread which strengtheneth man’s heart.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 9,
            "end": 13
          },
          {
            "start": 44,
            "end": 47
          },
          {
            "start": 60,
            "end": 63
          },
          {
            "start": 89,
            "end": 94
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 15,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 104:15",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 104,
        "verse": 15
      },
      {
        "text": "The trees of the Lord are full of sap; the cedars of Lebanon, which he hath planted;",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 4,
            "end": 9,
            "text": "Num. 24:6."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 31,
            "end": 38
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 16,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Num. 24:6.",
            "prettyString": "Numbers 24:6",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
                "book": "numbers",
                "chapters": [
                  {
                    "start": 24,
                    "end": 24,
                    "verses": [
                      {
                        "start": 6,
                        "end": 6
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 104:16",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 104,
        "verse": 16
      },
      {
        "text": "Where the birds make their nests: as for the stork, the fir trees are her house.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 34,
            "end": 40
          },
          {
            "start": 66,
            "end": 69
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 17,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 104:17",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 104,
        "verse": 17
      },
      {
        "text": "The high hills are a refuge for the wild goats; and the rocks for the conies.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 70,
            "end": 76,
            "text": "OR rock badgers."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 15,
            "end": 18
          },
          {
            "start": 48,
            "end": 51
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 18,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 104:18",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 104,
        "verse": 18
      },
      {
        "text": "He appointed the moon for seasons: the sun knoweth his going down.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 17,
            "end": 21,
            "text": "Gen. 1:14; Moses 2:14 (3–5, 14)."
          },
          {
            "start": 22,
            "end": 33,
            "text": "IE to indicate the time of month and year."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 19,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 104:19",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 104,
        "verse": 19
      },
      {
        "text": "Thou makest darkness, and it is night: wherein all the beasts of the forest do creep forth.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 85,
            "end": 91
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 20,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 104:20",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 104,
        "verse": 20
      },
      {
        "text": "The young lions roar after their prey, and seek their meat from God.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 21,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 104:21",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 104,
        "verse": 21
      },
      {
        "text": "The sun ariseth, they gather themselves together, and lay them down in their dens.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 22,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 104:22",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 104,
        "verse": 22
      },
      {
        "text": "Man goeth forth unto his work and to his labour until the evening.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 23,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 104:23",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 104,
        "verse": 23
      },
      {
        "text": "O Lord, how manifold are thy works! in wisdom hast thou made them all: the earth is full of thy riches.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 96,
            "end": 102,
            "text": "HEB creations. TG Treasure."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 24,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 104:24",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 104,
        "verse": 24
      },
      {
        "text": "So is this great and wide sea, wherein are things creeping innumerable, both small and great beasts.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 5
          },
          {
            "start": 39,
            "end": 42
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 25,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 104:25",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 104,
        "verse": 25
      },
      {
        "text": "There go the ships: there is that leviathan, whom thou hast made to play therein.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 20,
            "end": 28
          },
          {
            "start": 45,
            "end": 49
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 26,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 104:26",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 104,
        "verse": 26
      },
      {
        "text": "These wait all upon thee; that thou mayest give them their meat in due season.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 48,
            "end": 52
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 27,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 104:27",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 104,
        "verse": 27
      },
      {
        "text": "That thou givest them they gather: thou openest thine hand, they are filled with good.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 4
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 28,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 104:28",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 104,
        "verse": 28
      },
      {
        "text": "Thou hidest thy face, they are troubled: thou takest away their breath, they die, and return to their dust.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 16,
            "end": 20,
            "text": "Ps. 30:7."
          },
          {
            "start": 64,
            "end": 70,
            "text": "TG Breath of Life."
          },
          {
            "start": 102,
            "end": 106,
            "text": "Moses 4:25."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 29,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
