        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 104:29",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 104,
        "verse": 29
      },
      {
        "text": "Thou sendest forth thy spirit, they are created: and thou renewest the face of the earth.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 30,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 104:30",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 104,
        "verse": 30
      },
      {
        "text": "The glory of the Lord shall endure for ever: the Lord shall rejoice in his works.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 31,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 104:31",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 104,
        "verse": 31
      },
      {
        "text": "He looketh on the earth, and it trembleth: he toucheth the hills, and they smoke.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 32,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 104:32",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 104,
        "verse": 32
      },
      {
        "text": "I will sing unto the Lord as long as I live: I will sing praise to my God while I have my being.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 33,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 104:33",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 104,
        "verse": 33
      },
      {
        "text": "My meditation of him shall be sweet: I will be glad in the Lord.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 3,
            "end": 13,
            "text": "TG Meditation."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 34,
        "crossReferences": [
